        "heading": "Virtual Staging Philadelphia, PA",
        "lede": "Virtual staging is a digital marketing technique in real estate: a designer adds furniture and decor to photos of empty or cluttered rooms so buyers can read scale and layout, with no furniture moved into the house. Rowhomes are hard to photograph empty — long, narrow and dark in the middle — so Bella's designers stage Philadelphia listings in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo.",
